cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "WCT EVI MAP scripts: figures and tables for the evidence and gap map of acute myeloid leukaemia and precursor B-cell neoplasms"
abstract: >-
  Python scripts for generating figures and tables for an evidence and gap map
  for haematopoietic non-solid cancers, particularly acute myeloid leukaemia
  (AML) and precursor B-cell neoplasms (B-ALL/LBL), as defined by the WHO
  Classification of Tumours (WCT) of Haematolymphoid Tumours.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "WCT EVI MAP project"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-30
license: MIT
keywords:
  - evidence and gap map
  - WHO Classification of Tumours
  - acute myeloid leukaemia
  - B-lymphoblastic leukaemia/lymphoma
  - levels of evidence
  - EPPI-Reviewer
  - WCT EVI MAP
